WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.103
(ambient music)

00:00:32.717 --> 00:00:35.648
- [Narrator] Fabrice Schnöller
is an engineer, biologist,

00:00:35.648 --> 00:00:38.510
and founder of the DAREWIN Project.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:43.510
His goal is to record and analyze
sperm whale vocalizations.

00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:57.551
Sperm whales communicate using
a series of complex clicking.

00:00:57.551 --> 00:01:01.968
Some clicks are as short as
a thousandth of a second.

00:01:20.824 --> 00:01:23.857
Fabrice's objective is to
gather as many recordings of the

00:01:23.857 --> 00:01:27.694
whales as possible, to figure
out if that language exists.

00:01:27.694 --> 00:01:28.846
But sperm whales are not the

00:01:28.846 --> 00:01:31.513
easiest animals to get close to.

00:01:43.684 --> 00:01:46.789
By free-diving - diving on
a single breath of air -

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:51.289
Fabrice is able to get
incredibly close to the whales.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:04.501
(ambient music)

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:06.380
It's through these intimate interactions

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:07.883
that Fabrice is able to capture

00:02:07.883 --> 00:02:09.627
the recordings he needs to one day

00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:13.127
unlock the secret of their communication.

